                                     "text":  "The sirloin steak was tender and juicy, very delicious. The cream bun was bursting with filling, so be careful when eating it. The corn chowder was okay, but adding the puff pastry chowder at half price was a great deal.\n\nThe freshly squeezed juice was excellent! ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️\nThank you for the treat! 🫶",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
