                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The environment was clean and comfortable, the food was delicious, the beef was very tender, the puff pastry and rich soup were so good and there were so many ingredients! The owner\u0027s service was excellent.\n\nThe air was also very well-ventilated; there was no lingering smell of oil and smoke like you\u0027d find in a steakhouse.\n\nYou absolutely must try the limited-edition handmade Sicilian coffee! The creamy coffee foam paired with the lemon aroma, and the lingering sweet, salty, and sour aftertaste made me want to down the whole cup in one gulp! 😅\n\n#The steak was huge and delicious!\n\n#The teppanyaki noodles were so chewy and fragrant!\n\n#The Sicilian coffee was professional and delicious!\n\n#The staff were all very friendly!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "環境乾淨舒服 東西好吃 牛肉很嫩 酥皮濃湯好好喝料超級多 老闆服務超級好\n\n空氣也很流通\n沒有牛排館那種油煙味在身上殘留\n\n手工限量的西西里咖啡一定要點\n綿密的咖啡泡泡搭上檸檬香氣\n尾韻在嘴中散發濃濃的鹹甜酸\n讓我忍不住一口乾杯喝光光😅\n\n#牛排好大塊好好吃\n#鐵板麵好Q好香\n#西西里咖啡專業好喝\n#服務人員都很親切喔",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
